    dct:description "Participant archives NOR011, NOR025, NOR047, NOR053, NOR057, NOR062, NOR063, NOR064, NOR065, NOR073; the 'RPE ROIs - Corrected Segmentation' TIFFs (184 x 184 px, ~0.81-0.92 um/px, grader-corrected cell boundaries) were used; 206 ROIs in total" ;
    delphi:hasChecksum "sha256:c677fbbf0bd1894691bd93b727c6b28e6d3d3732dced5006404ebbb79141ea53" ;
    prov:atLocation <https://datadryad.org/downloads/file_stream/92638> ;
